    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nStep Inside Our 3 Bedroom Show Home | Available to View by Appointment\n\nThis highly anticipated release features a selection of 3-bedroom terraced and semi-detached homes, including The Ash, The Holly and The Beech, located on the much sought-after Oakmount Drive, together with just two 4-bedroom semi-detached Elm style homes.\n\nWith limited availability, this release offers a rare opportunity to secure a new home in one of Wicklow's most desirable communities.\n\n\nA sophisticated collection of expansive, design-forward 3, 4 & 5 bedroom homes, created for those seeking uncompromising quality. \n\nRegister your interest at www.altidoregardens.ie/Oakmount \n\nThis unique home delivers a striking layout with a focus on space, light and modern living. A wide hallway leads to three well proportioned double bedrooms on the ground floor, including a master ensuite, family bathroom, dedicated laundry room and clever under stair storage, spacious enough to convert to an additional study nook. Upstairs, the design opens into a flowing kitchen, dining and living space, complemented by a walk-in pantry. A separate lounge and a flexible living space - serving as a fourth bedroom or home office, ideal for overnight stays or daily use - both open through doors onto a spacious west-facing terrace, soaking up the evening sun before stepping into a spacious garden. With side gate access and abundant storage throughout, this home seamlessly balances everyday practicality with a refined, high-quality finish.\n\nPoised in the foothills of the Wicklow Mountains, Oakmount emerges as the signature chapter of a thriving community at Altidore Gardens. This double fronted home is designed with balance and comfort in mind, offering generous spaces across both levels. On the ground floor, one side features a large separate living room with bay window and patio doors opening to the garden, while the other side flows into an expansive open plan kitchen, dining and living zone, also with double doors to the garden. The entrance hall is anchored by a WC, utility room and stairs leading to the upper floor. Upstairs, three double bedrooms include a master ensuite with walk in wardrobe, alongside a single bedroom, main family bathroom and additional storage. The layout combines practicality with a sense of quality, making it ideal for modern family living.\n \nEach home features spacious, intelligently planned layouts with light-filled interiors. At the heart of each home, floor-to-ceiling contemporary shaker kitchens create a refined focal point, dressed in quartz-stone worktops and matching splash-backs. Hidden delights such as pantries, laundry rooms, and quietly clever storage niches tuck themselves seamlessly into the design, making everyday living feel effortless. The bathrooms continue this sense of gentle indulgence, with wall-hung wash-hand basin cabinets, back-lit mirrors, and striking large-profile tiling in both the main bathrooms and ensuites, creating serene spaces that feel wonderfully removed from the ordinary.\n \nThe Linear Park the jewel in the crown at the heart of the community \n\nAt the heart of Altidore Gardens, a newly opened 8.1-hectare linear park stands as the jewel in the crown of this thoughtfully designed neighbourhood. It weaves wildflower meadows, planted woodlands, and natural habitats into a 1.5km loop of walking, running, and cycling routes -creating a vibrant green space where residents, wildlife, and the wider Newtownmountkennedy community can connect, explore, and flourish. \n \nWhere connections grow and roots run deep. \n\nNestled within the enchanting woodlands and glens of the Garden County, Newtownmountkennedy is a village where natural beauty meets everyday convenience. Its charming streets are filled with boutique shops, artisanal caf s, and local schools, while the breathtaking Wicklow Mountains lie just beyond, offering endless opportunities for outdoor adventure and quiet reflection. Here, a vibrant community spirit blends effortlessly with the tranquility of the surrounding landscape, creating a truly inspiring place to call home. \n \nConnected yet wonderfully serene, Oakmount offers residents the best of both worlds: easy access to the N11 and M11, with regular Bus ireann and TFI services providing seamless links to Dublin and nearby towns.\n\nPlease note that the pictures attached are indicative only. The interior images represent the 3 Bedroom 'The Holly' house in Oakmount and are indicative of finish and craftmanship."
      },
